file_name": "segull.png", "id": "3894615550778611", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391959_3894615554111944_7745214895827150132_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eGuyEA6btYMQ7kNvwE1GUHy&_nc_oc=AdqbabTahPDpKYLffK1liAuIENHry0hDsjhsE_280rctgeof4SsBe1vTrUBlti-964g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTYsDR47PIIrxEdb2Rv9MTwI9JwGfxiIj1oHblfFQTV7w&oe=6B0B12AE"}, "display_name": "Hidden Objects Tropical Island", "keywords": ["hidden", "tropical", "JamieDornan", "nonviolent", "family"], "long_description": "Find the hidden objects on this beautiful tropical island, exploring land, sea, and air.  Game is re-playable multiple times, with object locations shuffled. Pleasant, relaxing, and non-violent.\n\nIncludes a Jamie Dornan tribute, with objects from his movies, other shows, and real life, plus fun facts. (Although some of Jamie's shows are adult, this game is completely family-friendly.)  Or if you're not particularly a fan, just enjoy finding the objects, 52 in all: Helicopter, submarine, wolf, sheriff's car, wooden sword, ice cream cone, stethoscope, camera, microphone, metal detector, ambulance, and more, even the kitchen sink.\n\nFull version; no ads; no IAPs; no data collected about you nor your device. Just plain fun!\n", "short_description": "Find the hidden objects on this beautiful tropical island, exploring land, sea, and air.  Game is re-playable multiple times, with object locations shuffled. Includes (family-friendly) Jamie Dornan tribute. Helicopter, submarine, wolf, sheriff's car, wooden sword, ice cream cone, and more.  Full version; no ads; no IAPs; no data collected about you nor your device. Just plain fun!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_8owt359ta8z20HrlFwpUNmGU0hSXmLHNNXKcCddKss/edit?tab=t.0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Elisa Collins", "support_website_